### ASCII Algorithm

```text
Start
  ↓
prev = head, curr = head.next
  ↓
Traverse while curr.next exists
  ↓
Is curr a critical point?
  ├── No → Move forward
  │
  └── Yes
       ↓
   First critical?
   ├── Yes → first = index
   └── No  → minDist = min(minDist, index - last)
       ↓
     last = index
       ↓
Move prev, curr, index
  ↓
Are there < 2 critical points?
  ├── Yes → [-1, -1]
  └── No
       ↓
[max distance = last - first]
       ↓
Return [minDist, maxDist]
```
